WEBVTT

00:05:58.813 --> 00:06:02.108
chances are they'd assign
value to their own.

00:06:02.608 --> 00:06:05.236
Bedroom musical play
could be the first time

00:06:05.277 --> 00:06:08.614
a girl tunes in to her own
internal signals,

00:06:08.656 --> 00:06:10.408
self-regulates it,

00:06:10.449 --> 00:06:14.954
and learns to say "Yes!"
as well as, "Nope, not today."

00:06:15.496 --> 00:06:18.582
But online, bedroom musical play,

00:06:18.624 --> 00:06:22.169
like listening to your gut
or your stomach,

00:06:22.169 --> 00:06:25.297
well, it's not a solo act.

00:06:25.798 --> 00:06:31.720
Stereotypes and stigmas fed by algorithms
and audiences are silencing us.